  "premise": "Tsukushi Makino, a girl from an ordinary family, is pushed by her mother into Eitoku Academy, an elite school ruled by the F4, four sons of Japan's richest families who drive students out with a 'red card' campaign of bullying. When Tsukushi fights back, F4 leader Tsukasa Domyoji falls for her; she first loves the gentle Rui Hanazawa, then slowly returns Tsukasa's feelings as he changes, while his mother opposes the match across class lines. The best-selling shojo manga, published in English by VIZ Media.",
  "life_message": "Integrity and courage matter more than wealth, and love can change a person.",
